  "citation": "Raich J W; Potter C S; Bhagawati D (2003): Interannual Variability in Global Soil Respiration on a 0.5 Degree Grid Cell Basis (1980-1994). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/LUE.NDP081",
